-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Third-Party Software
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

pathos links against the malachite arbitrary-precision arithmetic library
(the crates malachite-base, malachite-nz and malachite-q), which is licensed
under GNU LGPL v3.  See the file licenses/lgpl-3.0.txt for a copy of that
license.  Note that according to the terms of the LGPL, both pathos's source,
and the combined work (pathos linked with malachite) may (and do) remain under
the more permissive modified BSD license.

The other libraries linked into the binary come with malachite and are under
permissive licenses.  A binary release lists them, with their license files,
in licenses/ (see scripts/package).
